{41 = 41-51}
191=41.	@q{“My threshing-floors punctuating the plain  
195=42.	are yellow hillocks radiating beauty. 
199=43.	I pile up stacks and mounds for @wDN{Enlil}. 
203=44.	I amass emmer and wheat for him. 
207=45.	I fill the storehouses of mankind with barley. 
