{67 = 67-75}
303=67.	@q{“I build embankments, I dig ditches. 
307=68.	I fill all the meadows with water. 
311=69.	When I make water pour into all the reedbeds, 
315=70.	my small baskets carry it away. When a canal is cut, 
319=71.	or when a ditch is cut, 
