{91 = 91-103}
399=91.	@q{“When you come out to the field after me, 
403=92.	your single furrow brings you pleasure. 
407=93.	When you put your head to work and get entangled in roots and thorns, 
411=94.	your tooth breaks. 
415=95.	Once your tooth is fixed, 
419=96.	you cannot hold onto your tooth. 
423=97.	Your farmer calls you "This Plough is done for". 
427=98.	Carpenters have to be hired again for you, 
