439=101.	The fullers depilate a …… fleece for you. 
443=102.	They stretch it over the wringer for you. 
447=103.	They toil at the straps for you -- then they place the foul hide on your head.”} 

{104 = 104-108}
451=104.	@q{“Your work is slight but your behaviour is grand. 
455=105.	My time of duty is twelve months, 
459=106.	but your effective time is four  
463=107.	months and your time of absence is  
467=108.	eight months -- you are gone for twice as long as you are present.”} 

{109 = 109-116}
471=109.	@q{“Upon your boat (?) you make a hut. 
